        "created_at": "2013-11-30T10:00:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, this time there was never a moment when we were clearly losing - we'd just started to stabilize, and then bam, both decks decided to be evil to us.&nbsp; 11 damage to everyone without any warning at all - no shame in being defeated by that level of bad luck.&nbsp; We gave it a good damn try this time, and were well on our way to winning if not for those unfortunate turns of cards.</p>",
