        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-15T12:15:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I assumed that you had stopped running them because you were busy, and I did ep 21, and I don't really mind the work, but if I'm running I can't really play, so I would not mind a bit if you'd do the next.&nbsp; Maybe we can take turns so as to give each other the chance?&nbsp; If so, we may want to wrangle the involved players a bit so that they're not getting twice as many games as us...I think we have enough regulars to fill out two sets of games at once, esp. if we're not married to H equalling 5 all the time.</p>",
