        "cooked": "<p>Are these games open to anyone on the forum?</p><p>I'm interested, but there are two things that I think my restrict my participation.</p><p>1. Not always available to get turns in other than mid- to late- evenings (east coast)</p><p>2. Currently only have the Shattered Timelines expansion and core game.&nbsp; So I wouldn't be able to handle, or necessarily provide proper support, to the heroes from the other expansions.&nbsp; Plus a lack of knowledge about the villains and environments from the first two expansions as well.</p>",
