        "created_at": "2013-12-15T15:52:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sometimes we think about the player order if there are multiple people with time restrictions, but it's not a big deal. There have been other players without all the expansions, maybe they can speak to how hard it is to follow.</p>",
