      {
        "id": 82618,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-16T03:50:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am such a someone, dpt.&nbsp; I can assure Oaktree that, while the first couple games can be bewildering if you don't know the characters involved, you eventually reach a point where you're sufficiently familiar with everything.&nbsp; At first I had to set up the whole game and go through the motions, which restricted me to using heroes I owned, but by now I'm comfortable just going with my recollection of what things do, and occasionally double-checking.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I did, but I am substantially less busy for the next month or so… We could run two at once (well, three if you count phantaskippy's); I'll set up episode 22 now, and you can do episode 23 if you like <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually I'm thinking that I should do a slightly tweaked game series…not as major as the Shattered Storyline, but some kind of theme battles with continuity or minor hourserules or something.</p>",
        "post_number": 84,
        "post_type": 1,
